"run 'sudo dagric-drivers' in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Dagric ha encontrado una tarjeta gráfica NVIDIA.\n"
"\n"
"¿Instalar ahora el controlador propietario de NVIDIA para obtener el mejor\n"
"rendimiento y autonomía?\n"
"\n"
"Siempre puedes hacerlo más tarde: busca «Terminar configuración» en el menú "
"de\n"
"aplicaciones o ejecuta «sudo dagric-drivers» en un terminal."

#. TRANSLATORS: "sudo dagric-drivers" is a command typed verbatim.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:16
msgid "Run with sudo: sudo dagric-drivers"
msgstr "Ejecútalo con sudo: sudo dagric-drivers"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:20
msgid "Dagric driver check"
msgstr "Comprobación de controladores de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:23
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected:"
msgstr "Tarjeta gráfica NVIDIA detectada:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:33
msgid ""
"Install NVIDIA's proprietary driver from the system's non-free repository? "
"[y/N]"
msgstr ""
"¿Instalar el controlador propietario de NVIDIA desde el repositorio non-free "
"del sistema? [s/N]"

#. TRANSLATORS: this warns that skipping the enrollment step
#. leaves the machine at a BLACK SCREEN after reboot. Keep that
#. consequence explicit — it is the whole point of the notice.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:49
msgid ""
"NOTE: Secure Boot is ON. The NVIDIA driver builds a kernel\n"
"module that must be signed and enrolled, or it won't load\n"
"(black screen). Dagric will set up the signing key and ask\n"
"you to enroll it — you'll finish that at the next reboot."
msgstr ""
"NOTA: el Arranque seguro está ACTIVADO. El controlador de NVIDIA compila un\n"
"módulo del núcleo que debe ir firmado y registrado o no se cargará\n"
"(pantalla en negro). Dagric preparará la clave de firma y te pedirá que la\n"
"registres; eso lo terminarás en el siguiente reinicio."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:82
msgid ""
"Could not reach the package servers.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing was changed — try again when you are back online."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo contactar con los servidores de paquetes.\n"
"\n"
"No se cambió nada: inténtalo de nuevo cuando vuelvas a tener conexión."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:138
msgid ""
"Could not work out which NVIDIA driver this card needs.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing has been installed, and your screen keeps working on the open-"
"source\n"
"driver it is using now. Installing the wrong branch would disable that "
"driver\n"
"and could leave you with a black screen, so this stops instead of guessing.\n"
"\n"
"Check your connection and try again — or report the card at\n"
"https://dagric.com/support and we will tell you which driver it takes."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo determinar qué controlador de NVIDIA necesita esta tarjeta.\n"
"\n"
"No se ha instalado nada y tu pantalla sigue funcionando con el controlador\n"
"de código abierto que usa ahora. Instalar la rama equivocada lo "
"desactivaría\n"
"y podrías quedarte con la pantalla en negro; se detiene en vez de adivinar.\n"
"\n"
"Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de nuevo, o indícanos la tarjeta en\n"
"https://dagric.com/support y te diremos qué controlador necesita."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:172
msgid ""
"The driver did not install.\n"
"\n"
"The open-source driver has been left switched on, so your screen keeps "
"working.\n"
"If you were offline, try again when you are back online; otherwise report "
"the\n"
"card at https://dagric.com/support and we will tell you which driver it "
"takes."
msgstr ""
"El controlador no se instaló.\n"
"\n"
"El controlador de código abierto ha quedado activado, así que tu pantalla "
"sigue\n"
"funcionando. Si estabas sin conexión, inténtalo al recuperarla; si no,\n"
"indícanos la tarjeta en https://dagric.com/support y te diremos cuál "
"necesita."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:204
msgid ""
"WARNING: the NVIDIA kernel module did not finish building.\n"
"The open-source driver has been switched back on, so the screen still works\n"
"after a reboot. Re-run this helper afterwards and it will report what went\n"
"wrong."
msgstr ""
"ADVERTENCIA: el módulo del núcleo de NVIDIA no terminó de compilarse.\n"
"Se ha vuelto a activar el controlador de código abierto, así que la pantalla\n"
"seguirá funcionando tras reiniciar. Vuelve a ejecutar este asistente después\n"
"y te dirá qué falló."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'MOK Management', 'Enroll MOK' and 'Continue' are
#. the literal words on the blue firmware screen at the next
#. boot. That screen is ENGLISH ONLY and cannot be translated, so
#. these three must stay in English or the owner will hunt for a
#. button that is not there. Everything around them should be
#. translated.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:225
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT — finish Secure Boot enrollment:\n"
"  1. Reboot now.\n"
"  2. At the blue 'MOK Management' screen, choose\n"
"     'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' and enter the password\n"
"     you were just asked for.\n"
"  3. The system boots into the NVIDIA driver.\n"
"If you skip this, the driver won't load and you'll fall\n"
"back to the open-source driver. You can re-run this anytime."
msgstr ""
"IMPORTANTE — termina el registro del Arranque seguro:\n"
"  1. Reinicia ahora.\n"
"  2. En la pantalla azul 'MOK Management', elige\n"
"     'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' e introduce la contraseña\n"
"     que se te acaba de pedir.\n"
"  3. El sistema arranca con el controlador de NVIDIA.\n"
"Si te lo saltas, el controlador no se cargará y volverás al\n"
"controlador de código abierto. Puedes repetir esto cuando quieras."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:234
msgid "Done. Reboot to switch to the NVIDIA driver."
msgstr "Listo. Reinicia para cambiar al controlador de NVIDIA."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:240
msgid ""
"No NVIDIA GPU found. AMD and Intel graphics use the built-in\n"
"open-source drivers — nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró ninguna tarjeta NVIDIA. Las gráficas de AMD e Intel usan los\n"
"controladores de código abierto integrados: no hay nada que instalar."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:376
msgid "Theme default"
msgstr "Predeterminado del tema"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:377
msgid "Dagric blue"
msgstr "Azul Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:378
msgid "Teal"
msgstr "Verde azulado"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:379
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Verde"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:380
msgid "Amber"
msgstr "Ámbar"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:381
msgid "Coral"
msgstr "Coral"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:382
msgid "Violet"
msgstr "Violeta"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:383
msgid "Pink"
msgstr "Rosa"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:384
msgid "Slate"
msgstr "Pizarra"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:623
msgid ""
"The text size could not be changed here. Open System Settings ▸ Display & "
"Monitor to set it."
msgstr ""
"Aquí no se pudo cambiar el tamaño del texto. Abre Preferencias del sistema ▸ "
"Pantalla y monitor para ajustarlo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:770
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to $EDITION_NAME.\n"
"\n"
"The setup window could not be opened on this machine, so here is the\n"
"short version. Every question can be skipped, and nothing here is\n"
"permanent — you can change all of it later from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr ""
"Te damos la bienvenida a $EDITION_NAME.\n"
"\n"
"La ventana de configuración no se pudo abrir en este equipo, así que aquí "
"tienes\n"
"la versión corta. Puedes saltarte cualquier pregunta y nada de esto es "
"definitivo:\n"
"podrás cambiarlo todo más tarde desde el Dagric Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:778
msgid "Light or dark?"
msgstr "¿Claro u oscuro?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:780
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:793
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:804
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:819
msgid "Stop here — I'll finish later"
msgstr "Parar aquí: lo termino más tarde"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:792
msgid "Pick a wallpaper:"
msgstr "Elige un fondo de pantalla:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:800
msgid "How big should everything be?"
msgstr "¿De qué tamaño quieres que sea todo?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:801
msgid "Normal (100%)"
msgstr "Normal (100 %)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:802
msgid "Bigger (125%)"
msgstr "Más grande (125 %)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:803
msgid "Biggest (150%)"
msgstr "El más grande (150 %)"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed"
#. is the product's central promise, said to somebody who is afraid of
#. losing the Windows install they may still need. Keep the negation and
#. keep the emphasis on READ.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:831
msgid ""
"A Windows drive was found on this PC.\n"
"\n"
"Bring your Documents, Pictures, Music, Videos and browser bookmarks\n"
"across now? Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed."
msgstr ""
"Se ha encontrado un disco de Windows en este PC.\n"
"\n"
"¿Traer ahora tus Documentos, Imágenes, Música, Vídeos y los marcadores del\n"
"navegador? Windows solo se LEE: allí no se cambia nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: "Dagric Hub", "Dagric Manual" and "Set Up Dagric" are the
#. names the owner has to TYPE into the launcher to find these things, so
#. they must match the Name= of dagric-hub.desktop, dagric-manual.desktop
#. and dagric-firstrun.desktop in your language, exactly. "Dagric Hub" is
#. not translated at all — it is a product name.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:845
msgid ""
"You're set up.\n"
"\n"
"Everything else lives in the Dagric Hub — press the launcher and type\n"
"\"Dagric Hub\". The offline User Guide is in there, and so is the\n"
"Dagric Manual: a page on every app on this computer and what it\n"
"replaced on Windows.\n"
"\n"
"To see this again, open \"Set Up Dagric\" from the launcher."
msgstr ""
"Ya está todo configurado.\n"
"\n"
"Todo lo demás está en el Dagric Hub: abre el menú de aplicaciones y escribe\n"
"«Dagric Hub». Allí está la Guía del usuario sin conexión y también el\n"
"Manual de Dagric: una página por cada aplicación de este ordenador y a qué\n"
"sustituye de Windows.\n"
"\n"
"Para volver a ver esto, abre «Configurar Dagric» desde el menú de "
"aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:1174
msgid "Dagric is set up. Everything else lives in the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Dagric ya está configurado. Todo lo demás está en el Dagric Hub."

#. TRANSLATORS: "wine setup.exe" and "dagric-get-steam" are commands typed
#. verbatim. Wine, winetricks, gamemode, mangohud, Vulkan, Proton, Proton-GE,
#. Steam and GloriousEggroll are product names — leave them all as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:13
msgid ""
"Dagric gaming setup\n"
"=====================\n"
"Already preinstalled on Dagric Pro:\n"
"  * Wine + winetricks       run Windows apps:  wine setup.exe\n"
"  * gamemode + mangohud     performance governor + FPS overlay\n"
"  * 32-bit Vulkan           ready for Proton's Windows games\n"
"\n"
"Steam itself is NEVER bundled (it is proprietary) — install it any time\n"
"with one click from the Dagric Hub, or run:  dagric-get-steam\n"
"\n"
"This helper adds Proton-GE (GloriousEggroll's community Proton with\n"
"extra media codecs and game-specific fixes) for a Steam you've installed."
msgstr ""
"Configuración de juegos de Dagric\n"
"=====================\n"
"Ya preinstalado en Dagric Pro:\n"
"  * Wine + winetricks       ejecutar aplicaciones de Windows:  wine setup."
"exe\n"
"  * gamemode + mangohud     regulador de rendimiento + contador de FPS\n"
"  * Vulkan de 32 bits       listo para los juegos de Windows con Proton\n"
"\n"
"Steam en sí NUNCA se incluye (es propietario): instálalo cuando quieras con "
"un clic\n"
"desde el Dagric Hub, o ejecuta:  dagric-get-steam\n"
"\n"
"Este asistente añade Proton-GE (el Proton comunitario de GloriousEggroll, "
"con códecs\n"
"multimedia extra y arreglos para juegos concretos) para un Steam ya "
"instalado."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:46
msgid "Download the latest Proton-GE from GitHub? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Descargar el último Proton-GE desde GitHub? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:57
msgid "Steam data dir not found. Launch Steam once first, then re-run this."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró el directorio de datos de Steam. Abre Steam una vez y vuelve "
"a ejecutar esto."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:66
msgid "Could not find the latest release (offline?). Try again later."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo encontrar la última versión (¿sin conexión?). Inténtalo más tarde."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:69
#, sh-format
msgid "Downloading: $URL"
msgstr "Descargando: $URL"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:98
msgid ""
"Download failed — nothing was installed. Check your connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"La descarga falló: no se instaló nada. Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de "
"nuevo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:107
msgid ""
"The download was damaged and could not be unpacked — nothing was installed."
msgstr ""
"La descarga estaba dañada y no se pudo descomprimir: no se instaló nada."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:113
msgid ""
"Could not move the unpacked files into Steam's folder — nothing was "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"No se pudieron mover los archivos descomprimidos a la carpeta de Steam: no "
"se instaló nada."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:119
#, sh-format
msgid "Installed to $DEST"
msgstr "Instalado en $DEST"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Settings", "Compatibility" and "Properties" are Steam's own
#. menu labels — use the words Steam shows in your language, if you know them.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:122
msgid ""
"In Steam: Settings > Compatibility > enable, then pick the GE-Proton\n"
"version per game under Properties > Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"En Steam: Configuración > Compatibilidad > activar, y luego elegir la "
"versión\n"
"de GE-Proton por juego en Propiedades > Compatibilidad."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:146
msgid ""
"One more thing: GameMode can give a running game priority over\n"
"everything else, which smooths out stutter on slower machines. That needs "
"your\n"
"account added to the \"gamemode\" group, and it takes effect at your next "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Una cosa más: GameMode puede dar prioridad a un juego en marcha sobre\n"
"todo lo demás, lo que suaviza los tirones en equipos lentos. Para eso hay "
"que\n"
"añadir tu cuenta al grupo «gamemode», y tendrá efecto en tu próxima sesión."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:149
msgid "Add your account to the gamemode group? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Añadir tu cuenta al grupo gamemode? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:153
msgid "Done — log out and back in for it to take effect."
msgstr "Listo: cierra la sesión y vuelve a entrar para que surta efecto."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:155
msgid ""
"Could not change the group (administrator access is required). Games still "
"run; only the priority boost is skipped."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo cambiar el grupo (hace falta acceso de administrador). Los juegos "
"siguen funcionando; solo se omite el aumento de prioridad."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:158
msgid "Left as it is. Games still run normally."
msgstr "Se deja como está. Los juegos siguen funcionando con normalidad."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:18
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Bottles (run Windows apps)\n"
"\n"
"Bottles is a free, open-source app that runs Windows programs and games on\n"
"Linux inside self-contained \"bottles\", tuned per app for the best chance "
"of\n"
"working. It's the easy way to bring a Windows app across. Installs from "
"Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Bottles (ejecutar programas de Windows)\n"
"\n"
"Bottles es una aplicación libre y de código abierto que ejecuta programas y juegos\n"
"de Windows en Linux dentro de «botellas» independientes, ajustadas para cada\n"
"aplicación para que tenga la mayor probabilidad de funcionar. Es la forma sencilla\n"
"de traerte una aplicación de Windows. Se instala desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:25
msgid "Install Bottles now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Bottles ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:28
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:22
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:19
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:22
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:21
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:24
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:22
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:29
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:21
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:40
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:76
msgid "No changes made."
msgstr "No se ha cambiado nada."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:35
msgid "Bottles installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Bottles está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:37
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:31
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:28
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:31
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:32
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:33
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:31
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:30
msgid "Install did not complete. Check your network and try again."
msgstr ""
"La instalación no se completó. Comprueba tu conexión de red e inténtalo de "
"nuevo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Cryptomator (encrypt before the cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator creates encrypted vaults that live inside your normal cloud\n"
"folders. Your files are encrypted on your machine first, so Google, "
"Dropbox,\n"
"or anyone else only ever stores scrambled data. You hold the only key.\n"
"From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Cryptomator (cifrar antes de la nube)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator crea cajas fuertes cifradas que viven dentro de tus carpetas de "
"nube\n"
"habituales. Tus archivos se cifran primero en tu equipo, así que Google, "
"Dropbox o\n"
"cualquier otro solo llega a guardar datos ilegibles. La única llave la "
"tienes tú.\n"
"Desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:19
msgid "Install Cryptomator now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Cryptomator ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:29
msgid "Cryptomator installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Cryptomator está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:10
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic is a free, open-source launcher for your Epic Games, GOG, and Amazon\n"
"Prime Gaming libraries, with Proton/Wine built in. It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic es un lanzador libre y de código abierto para tus bibliotecas de Epic "
"Games,\n"
"GOG y Amazon Prime Gaming, con Proton/Wine incorporado. Se instala desde "
"Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:16
msgid "Install Heroic now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Heroic ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:26
msgid "Heroic installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Heroic está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Joplin (notes that stay yours)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin keeps notes, notebooks, and to-dos in plain Markdown on YOUR disk.\n"
"No account required, works fully offline, and if you ever want sync it's\n"
"end-to-end encrypted — to a folder, Syncthing, or your own server.\n"
"The private alternative to OneNote and Notion. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Joplin (notas que siguen siendo tuyas)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin guarda notas, cuadernos y tareas en Markdown sencillo en TU disco.\n"
"No hace falta cuenta, funciona totalmente sin conexión y, si algún día "
"quieres\n"
"sincronizar, va cifrado de extremo a extremo: a una carpeta, a Syncthing o a "
"tu\n"
"propio servidor.\n"
"La alternativa privada a OneNote y Notion. Desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:19
msgid "Install Joplin now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Joplin ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:29
msgid "Joplin installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Joplin está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install LocalSend (share files, privately)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend sends files and messages straight between your devices on the "
"same\n"
"network — phone, laptop, desktop — with no account, no cloud, and nothing\n"
"leaving your network. It's the private alternative to AirDrop. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar LocalSend (compartir archivos, en privado)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend envía archivos y mensajes directamente entre tus dispositivos de "
"la misma\n"
"red — móvil, portátil, sobremesa — sin cuenta, sin nube y sin que nada salga "
"de tu\n"
"red. La alternativa privada a AirDrop. Desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:18
msgid "Install LocalSend now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar LocalSend ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:29
msgid "LocalSend installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "LocalSend está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:30
msgid "Install it on your phone too (same name) and they'll find each other."
msgstr ""
"Instálalo también en tu móvil (mismo nombre) y los dispositivos se "
"encontrarán solos."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ONLYOFFICE", "LibreOffice", "Word", "Excel", "PowerPoint" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:13
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ONLYOFFICE (the familiar Office look)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an open-source office suite with the ribbon\n"
"layout Microsoft Office users already know, and excellent compatibility\n"
"with Word/Excel/PowerPoint files. It runs alongside LibreOffice — keep\n"
"whichever feels right (or both). From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar ONLYOFFICE (el aspecto de Office de siempre)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors es una suite ofimática de código abierto con la "
"cinta de\n"
"opciones que los usuarios de Microsoft Office ya conocen, y muy buena "
"compatibilidad\n"
"con archivos de Word/Excel/PowerPoint. Convive con LibreOffice: quédate con "
"la que\n"
"te resulte cómoda (o con las dos). Desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:21
msgid "Install ONLYOFFICE now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar ONLYOFFICE ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:31
msgid "ONLYOFFICE installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ONLYOFFICE está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ProtonUp-Qt", "Proton-GE", "Wine-GE", "Steam", "Lutris" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:12
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt is a free, open-source app for installing and switching between\n"
"Proton-GE and Wine-GE versions for Steam and Lutris — no terminal needed.\n"
"It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt es una aplicación libre y de código abierto para instalar y "
"cambiar\n"
"entre versiones de Proton-GE y Wine-GE para Steam y Lutris, sin usar el "
"terminal.\n"
"Se instala desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:19
msgid "Install ProtonUp-Qt now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar ProtonUp-Qt ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:29
msgid "ProtonUp-Qt installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ProtonUp-Qt está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are COMMANDS the owner types verbatim
#. into a terminal — cd, unzip, sudo and the file names must not be translated
#. or reflowed, or the instructions stop working. The last paragraph is a
#. LICENCE statement (Blackmagic forbids redistribution, which is why Dagric
#. does not bundle Resolve); keep that meaning exact. "DaVinci Resolve",
#. "Blackmagic", "NVIDIA" and "Dagric" are names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-resolve:17
msgid ""
"DaVinci Resolve on Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visit  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (opening it in your browser now if possible...)\n"
"2. Click \"Free Download\", pick the Linux version, and register.\n"
"3. Unzip the download, then run the installer:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. NVIDIA users: run  sudo dagric-drivers  first — Resolve on Linux\n"
"   performs best with the proprietary driver.\n"
"\n"
"Why isn't it preinstalled? Blackmagic's license forbids redistribution.\n"
"Any OS that bundles it is violating that license — Dagric won't."
msgstr ""
"DaVinci Resolve en Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visita  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (se abrirá en tu navegador ahora si es posible...)\n"
"2. Pulsa «Free Download», elige la versión de Linux y regístrate.\n"
"3. Descomprime la descarga y ejecuta el instalador:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. Usuarios de NVIDIA: ejecuta antes  sudo dagric-drivers  — en Linux,\n"
"   Resolve rinde mejor con el controlador propietario.\n"
"\n"
"¿Por qué no viene preinstalado? La licencia de Blackmagic prohíbe la\n"
"redistribución. Cualquier sistema que lo incluya está incumpliéndola: Dagric "
"no."

#. TRANSLATORS: this paragraph explains a LICENCE position — Dagric does not
#. bundle Steam because Valve's licence forbids it. Keep that meaning exact;
#. it is the reason the helper exists. "Steam" and "Valve" are product names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:16
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam is Valve's proprietary game store and launcher. Dagric doesn't ship "
"it\n"
"preinstalled (its licence forbids anyone bundling it), but installing it is "
"one\n"
"step. Everything it depends on is already set up on Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"You'll be asked for your administrator password, then Steam downloads and\n"
"installs. Afterwards, launch \"Steam\" from the application launcher."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam es la tienda y el lanzador de juegos propietarios de Valve. Dagric no "
"lo\n"
"incluye preinstalado (su licencia prohíbe a cualquiera distribuirlo con el "
"sistema),\n"
"pero instalarlo es un solo paso. Todo lo que necesita ya está preparado en "
"Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"Se te pedirá la contraseña de administrador y después Steam se descargará e\n"
"instalará. Luego abre «Steam» desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:26
msgid "Install Steam now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Steam ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:39
msgid ""
"Steam installed. Launch it from the application launcher; on first\n"
"run it finishes updating itself."
msgstr ""
"Steam está instalado. Ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones; en el primer\n"
"arranque termina de actualizarse."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:46
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Steam installation did not complete (exit $RC). You can retry from\n"
"the Dagric Hub, or check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"La instalación de Steam no se completó (código de salida $RC). Puedes "
"reintentarlo\n"
"desde el Dagric Hub o comprobar tu conexión de red."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Upscayl (AI image upscaler, offline)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl enlarges and sharpens photos and artwork using AI that runs locally "
"on\n"
"your machine — nothing is uploaded. Great for rescuing small or old images.\n"
"A capable GPU helps but isn't required. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Upscayl (ampliación de imágenes con IA, sin conexión)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl amplía y afina fotos e ilustraciones con IA que se ejecuta "
"localmente en tu\n"
"equipo: no se sube nada. Ideal para rescatar imágenes pequeñas o antiguas. "
"Una buena\n"
"tarjeta gráfica ayuda, pero no es imprescindible. Desde Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:18
msgid "Install Upscayl now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Upscayl ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:28
msgid "Upscayl installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Upscayl está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two bullet points are a PRIVACY disclosure — Variety can
#. fetch wallpapers from third-party websites, and that is why Dagric does not
#. preinstall it. Keep both the fact and the "OFF until you enable it" caveat.
#. "Slideshow" and "Configure Desktop and Wallpaper" are labels the owner has
#. to find in Plasma, so use the wording Plasma itself uses in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:20
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Variety (automatic wallpaper changer)\n"
"\n"
"Variety changes your wallpaper on a schedule, from your own folders and,\n"
"if you switch it on, from online collections. It adds a tray icon for\n"
"skipping, pausing and favouriting the current image.\n"
"\n"
"Two things worth knowing before you install:\n"
"  * Variety can download wallpapers from third-party websites. That is\n"
"    OFF until you enable a source, but it is why Dagric doesn't preinstall "
"it.\n"
"  * If you only want a rotating slideshow of your OWN pictures, you don't\n"
"    need this at all — right-click the desktop, Configure Desktop and\n"
"    Wallpaper, and choose \"Slideshow\".\n"
"\n"
"Installed from the system's own repositories (GPL-3, open source), about 25 "
"MB\n"
"with its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar Variety (cambio automático de fondo de pantalla)\n"
"\n"
"Variety cambia tu fondo de pantalla según un horario, desde tus propias "
"carpetas y,\n"
"si lo activas, desde colecciones en línea. Añade un icono en la bandeja para "
"saltar,\n"
"pausar y marcar como favorita la imagen actual.\n"
"\n"
"Dos cosas que conviene saber antes de instalarlo:\n"
"  * Variety puede descargar fondos de pantalla de sitios web de terceros. "
"Eso está\n"
"    DESACTIVADO hasta que habilites una fuente, pero es la razón por la que "
"Dagric\n"
"    no lo preinstala.\n"
"  * Si solo quieres una presentación rotativa de TUS propias imágenes, no "
"lo\n"
"    necesitas en absoluto: haz clic derecho en el escritorio, «Configurar "
"escritorio\n"
"    y fondo de pantalla» y elige «Presentación».\n"
"\n"
"Se instala desde los repositorios del sistema (GPL-3, código abierto), unos "
"25 MB con\n"
"sus dependencias."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:37
msgid "Install Variety now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Instalar Variety ahora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:46
msgid "Variety installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Variety está instalado: ábrelo desde el menú de aplicaciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:47
msgid "It starts in the system tray; right-click the icon for options."
msgstr ""
"Se inicia en la bandeja del sistema; haz clic derecho en el icono para ver "
"las opciones."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:61
msgid ""
"To rotate the wallpapers already on this computer, open\n"
"Variety's preferences, go to Images, choose Add and then Folder, and pick:\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/share/wallpapers\n"
"\n"
"That is the thirty-four Dagric packs, and every KDE wallpaper besides. A\n"
"folder source works entirely offline — nothing is downloaded and no website\n"
"is contacted."
msgstr ""
"Para rotar los fondos de pantalla que ya están en este ordenador, abre las\n"
"preferencias de Variety, ve a Imágenes, pulsa Añadir y luego Carpeta, y "
"elige:\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/share/wallpapers\n"
"\n"
"Son los treinta y cuatro paquetes de Dagric y, además, todos los fondos de\n"
"pantalla de KDE. Una carpeta como origen funciona sin conexión: no se "
"descarga\n"
"nada ni se contacta con ningún sitio web."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:71
msgid "Install did not complete (administrator access is required)."
msgstr "La instalación no se completó (hace falta acceso de administrador)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:72
msgid "You can try again from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Puedes intentarlo de nuevo desde el Dagric Hub."

