#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-looks:87
msgid ""
"No layouts are installed. Reinstall the dagric-branding package to restore "
"them."
msgstr ""
"No hay ninguna disposición instalada. Reinstala el paquete dagric-branding "
