#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-looks:103
msgid "Pick a layout — switch back anytime:"
msgstr "Elige una disposición; puedes volver atrás cuando quieras:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-looks:126
msgid ""
"The layout could not be applied — the desktop did not answer. If the panels "
"are missing now, log out and back in, then try again."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo aplicar la disposición — el escritorio no respondió. Si ahora "
"faltan los paneles, cierra la sesión y vuelve a entrar, y luego inténtalo de "
"nuevo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-looks:139
#, sh-format
msgid "Layout applied: $NAME"
msgstr "Disposición aplicada: $NAME"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:55
#, sh-format
msgid "The Dagric manual is not installed ($ROOT is missing)."
msgstr "El manual de Dagric no está instalado (falta $ROOT)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are the command's own syntax and
#. are typed verbatim — "dagric-manual", "--list", "--help" and the example
#. "dolphin" must not be translated. <topic> is a placeholder and may be.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:63
msgid ""
"Dagric manual — every application on this computer, offline.\n"
"\n"
"  dagric-manual              open the front page (search from there)\n"
"  dagric-manual <topic>      open one page, e.g.  dagric-manual dolphin\n"
"  dagric-manual --list       list every topic\n"
"  dagric-manual --help       this text\n"
"\n"
"Topics are matched against PAGE NAMES: \"kate\", \"app-kate\" and \"ate\" "
"all reach\n"
"the Kate page. Windows names do not work here -- \"notepad\" matches no "
"page\n"
"name, so it fails. Search by Windows name in the manual's own search box\n"
"instead; that index is what \"notepad finds Kate\" refers to.\n"
"\n"
"Pages live in /usr/share/dagric/manual and need no internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Manual de Dagric: todas las aplicaciones de este ordenador, sin conexión.\n"
"\n"
"  dagric-manual              abrir la portada (buscar desde ahí)\n"
"  dagric-manual <tema>       abrir una página, p. ej.  dagric-manual dolphin\n"
"  dagric-manual --list       listar todos los temas\n"
"  dagric-manual --help       este texto\n"
"\n"
"Los temas se comparan con NOMBRES DE PÁGINA: «kate», «app-kate» y «ate» llegan\n"
"todos a la página de Kate. Los nombres de Windows no funcionan aquí: «notepad» no\n"
"coincide con ningún nombre de página y falla. Busca por el nombre de Windows en el\n"
"buscador del propio manual; ese índice es al que se refiere «notepad encuentra Kate».\n"
"\n"
"Las páginas están en /usr/share/dagric/manual y no necesitan conexión a internet."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:137
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:141
#, sh-format
msgid "No page called \"$ASKED\". Try: dagric-manual --list"
msgstr "No hay ninguna página llamada \"$ASKED\". Prueba: dagric-manual --list"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:179
#, sh-format
msgid "No browser found. The manual is at $ROOT/$PAGE"
msgstr "No se encontró ningún navegador. El manual está en $ROOT/$PAGE"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:21
msgid "Dagric Migration Assistant"
msgstr "Asistente de migración de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:27
msgid ""
"You are running the LIVE session (from the USB stick).\n"
"\n"
"Anything copied here lands in memory and disappears at shutdown.\n"
"Best order: install Dagric first, then run Migration from the Hub.\n"
"\n"
"Continue anyway (e.g. to rescue a few files)?"
msgstr ""
"Estás en la sesión EN VIVO (desde la memoria USB).\n"
"\n"
"Todo lo que se copie aquí va a la memoria y desaparece al apagar.\n"
"Mejor orden: instala primero Dagric y luego ejecuta la migración desde el "
"Hub.\n"
"\n"
"¿Continuar de todos modos (por ejemplo, para rescatar unos pocos archivos)?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:37
msgid "Looking for a Windows installation…"
msgstr "Buscando una instalación de Windows…"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Settings > Privacy & security > Device encryption" is
#. a path through the WINDOWS settings app — use the wording Windows
#. itself uses in your language, because that is what the owner will be
#. reading on the other machine. "BitLocker" is a product name.
#. "Nothing on the drive was changed" is a promise; keep it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:109
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"A BitLocker-encrypted drive was found ($BITLOCKER) but Dagric cannot\n"
"unlock it without the recovery key.\n"
"\n"
"In Windows: turn off BitLocker (Settings > Privacy & security >\n"
"Device encryption), or copy your files to a plain USB drive instead.\n"
"Nothing on the drive was changed."
msgstr ""
"Se ha encontrado un disco cifrado con BitLocker ($BITLOCKER), pero Dagric no "
"puede\n"
"desbloquearlo sin la clave de recuperación.\n"
"\n"
"En Windows: desactiva BitLocker (Configuración > Privacidad y seguridad > "
"Cifrado\n"
"de dispositivo), o copia tus archivos a una memoria USB normal.\n"
"No se ha cambiado nada en el disco."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:116
msgid ""
"No Windows installation was found on this PC's drives.\n"
"\n"
"If a password prompt appeared and was cancelled, Dagric could not open\n"
"the Windows drive to look inside — run this again and approve it.\n"
"\n"
"If Windows lives on a drive that isn't plugged in, connect it and\n"
"run Migration again from the Dagric Hub. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado ninguna instalación de Windows en los discos de este "
"PC.\n"
"\n"
"Si apareció una petición de contraseña y se canceló, Dagric no pudo abrir el "
"disco\n"
"de Windows para mirar dentro: vuelve a ejecutar esto y acéptala.\n"
"\n"
"Si Windows está en un disco que no está conectado, conéctalo y vuelve a "
"ejecutar la\n"
"migración desde el Dagric Hub. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:146
#, sh-format
msgid "$dev — $sz of user files"
msgstr "$dev — $sz de archivos de usuario"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:149
msgid "Several Windows installations were found. Which one?"
msgstr "Se han encontrado varias instalaciones de Windows. ¿Cuál?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:168
#, sh-format
msgid "No user profiles were found in $WINMNT/Users."
msgstr "No se han encontrado perfiles de usuario en $WINMNT/Users."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:181
msgid "Which Windows user are you?"
msgstr "¿Qué usuario de Windows eres?"

#. TRANSLATORS: "(Files are COPIED — Windows keeps its own untouched.)" is the
#. single most important sentence in this tool. The owner is about to point it
#. at a Windows installation they may still need to boot. It must not read as
#. "moved", and the reassurance must survive.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:200
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Found Windows user \"$WINUSER\". What should come over to Dagric?\n"
"(Files are COPIED — Windows keeps its own untouched.)"
msgstr ""
"Se ha encontrado el usuario de Windows «$WINUSER». ¿Qué quieres traer a "
"Dagric?\n"
"(Los archivos se COPIAN: Windows conserva los suyos intactos.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:202
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Documentos"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:203
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Escritorio"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:204
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Imágenes"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:205
msgid "Music"
msgstr "Música"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:206
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Vídeos"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:207
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "Descargas"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:208
msgid "Browser bookmarks (Chrome / Edge / Firefox)"
msgstr "Marcadores del navegador (Chrome / Edge / Firefox)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:209
msgid "Browser tabs you had open"
msgstr "Pestañas del navegador que tenías abiertas"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:210
msgid "Saved passwords (Firefox only - Chrome explains why)"
msgstr "Contraseñas guardadas (solo Firefox: Chrome explica por qué)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:277
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Not enough space: your selection is $NEED_GB GB but this\n"
"disk only has $FREE_GB GB free. Deselect some folders\n"
"(Videos are usually the big one) and try again. Nothing was copied."
msgstr ""
"No hay espacio suficiente: tu selección ocupa $NEED_GB GB pero este\n"
"disco solo tiene $FREE_GB GB libres. Quita alguna carpeta de la selección\n"
"(los vídeos suelen ser lo más grande) e inténtalo de nuevo. No se ha copiado "
"nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: "read-only; Windows is not modified" is the promise the whole
#. tool rests on. It is a statement of fact about what is happening right now —
#. keep it, and keep it in the present tense.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:288
#, sh-format
msgid "=== Dagric Migration: copying from Windows user \"$WINUSER\" ==="
msgstr ""
"=== Migración de Dagric: copiando del usuario de Windows «$WINUSER» ==="

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:289
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"    reading $WINDEV mounted at $WINMNT (read-only; Windows is not modified)"
msgstr ""
"    leyendo $WINDEV montado en $WINMNT (solo lectura; Windows no se modifica)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:291
msgid "    (some files could not be read — skipped)"
msgstr "    (algunos archivos no se han podido leer: omitidos)"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Bookmarks > Manage Bookmarks > Import and Backup >
#. Import Bookmarks from HTML" is a path through FIREFOX's own menus.
#. Use the wording Firefox shows in your language, not a literal
#. translation, or the owner will look for a menu item that is not there.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:428
#, sh-format
msgid "Bookmarks saved to: $OUT"
msgstr "Marcadores guardados en: $OUT"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:429
msgid ""
"Import them in Firefox:  Bookmarks > Manage Bookmarks >\n"
"Import and Backup > Import Bookmarks from HTML."
msgstr ""
"Para importarlos en Firefox:  Marcadores > Administrar marcadores >\n"
"Importar y respaldar > Importar marcadores desde HTML."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:443
msgid "--- browser tabs and logins ---"
msgstr "--- pestañas y credenciales del navegador ---"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Primary Password" is Firefox's own term for the
#. master password — use whatever Firefox calls it in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:452
msgid ""
"If this person set a Primary Password in Firefox, type it so the saved\n"
"logins can be unlocked.\n"
"\n"
"Leave it blank if they never set one (most people haven't)."
msgstr ""
"Si esta persona puso una contraseña principal en Firefox, escríbela para poder\n"
"desbloquear las credenciales guardadas.\n"
"\n"
"Déjala en blanco si nunca puso ninguna (la mayoría no lo hace)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:495
msgid "the browser recovery helper did not finish"
msgstr "el asistente de recuperación del navegador no terminó"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:498
#, sh-format
msgid "Some browser data could not be read: $MIGFAIL"
msgstr "No se pudieron leer algunos datos del navegador: $MIGFAIL"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:510
#, sh-format
msgid "Recovered $N_TABS open tab -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgid_plural "Recovered $N_TABS open tabs -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgstr[0] "Recuperada $N_TABS pestaña abierta -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgstr[1] "Recuperadas $N_TABS pestañas abiertas -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:513
msgid ""
"No open tabs could be recovered - the session files could not be read.\n"
"  A half-written session file (an unclean Windows shutdown) can cause this."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido recuperar ninguna pestaña abierta: no se pudieron leer los\n"
"  archivos de sesión. Un archivo de sesión escrito a medias (un apagado incorrecto\n"
"  de Windows) puede ser la causa."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:516
msgid "No open tabs were found (the browsers may have been closed cleanly)."
msgstr ""
"No se han encontrado pestañas abiertas (puede que los navegadores se "
"cerraran correctamente)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:523
#, sh-format
msgid "Recovered $N_PWDS Firefox login -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgid_plural "Recovered $N_PWDS Firefox logins -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgstr[0] "Recuperada $N_PWDS credencial de Firefox -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgstr[1] ""
"Recuperadas $N_PWDS credenciales de Firefox -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"

#. TRANSLATORS: a plain-text file of the owner's passwords now
#. exists on disk. "Import it, then delete it" is an instruction,
#. and PLAIN TEXT must stay emphatic.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:528
msgid ""
"  This file is PLAIN TEXT and readable only by you.\n"
"  Import it, then delete it."
msgstr ""
"  Este archivo está en TEXTO PLANO y solo tú puedes leerlo.\n"
"  Impórtalo y después bórralo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:531
msgid "No Firefox logins were recovered."
msgstr "No se ha recuperado ninguna credencial de Firefox."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:538
msgid "Found a password file exported from Chrome:"
msgstr "Se ha encontrado un archivo de contraseñas exportado de Chrome:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:540
msgid "  Copy it to your home folder and import it the same way."
msgstr "  Cópialo a tu carpeta personal e impórtalo de la misma manera."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two indented lines are paths through
#. CHROME's and EDGE's settings, on the Windows machine — use
#. the wording those browsers show in your language. The first
#. paragraph explains WHY this cannot work; it is a security
#. property, not an apology, and should not be softened into one.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:548
msgid ""
"Chrome / Edge passwords could NOT be read, and no tool can read them here:\n"
"they are encrypted with a Windows key tied to that Windows account, which\n"
"does not exist on this system. That is a security feature, not a fault.\n"
"\n"
"To bring them over, do this ONCE while still in Windows:\n"
"  Chrome : Settings > Autofill and passwords > Google Password Manager\n"
"           > Settings > Download file\n"
"  Edge   : Settings > Profiles > Passwords > ... > Export passwords\n"
"Save the .csv, then run this migration again - it will pick it up."
msgstr ""
"Las contraseñas de Chrome / Edge NO se han podido leer, y ninguna "
"herramienta puede\n"
"leerlas aquí: están cifradas con una clave de Windows ligada a aquella "
"cuenta de\n"
"Windows, que no existe en este sistema. Eso es una medida de seguridad, no "
"un fallo.\n"
"\n"
"Para traerlas, haz esto UNA VEZ mientras sigas en Windows:\n"
"  Chrome : Configuración > Autocompletar y contraseñas > Administrador de\n"
"           contraseñas de Google > Configuración > Descargar archivo\n"
"  Edge   : Configuración > Perfiles > Contraseñas > ... > Exportar "
"contraseñas\n"
"Guarda el .csv y vuelve a ejecutar esta migración: lo detectará."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:563
msgid "=== Migration finished ==="
msgstr "=== Migración finalizada ==="

#. TRANSLATORS: the closing promise of the whole tool — "Windows itself was not
#. modified — it was only ever read" is the sentence the owner will remember,
#. and the one that decides whether they trust this product. Do not weaken the
#. negation. The ▸ chains are menu paths inside FIREFOX; use Firefox's own
#. wording in your language. File names (Windows-bookmarks.html,
#. Windows-open-tabs.html, Windows-passwords.csv) are literal and must not be
#. translated — the owner has to find them on disk.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:571
msgid ""
"Done! Your Windows files are now in your Dagric home folder.\n"
"\n"
"Windows itself was not modified — it was only ever read.\n"
"\n"
"To finish up, in Firefox:\n"
"• Bookmarks — Bookmarks ▸ Manage Bookmarks ▸ Import and Backup ▸\n"
"  Import Bookmarks from HTML ▸ Windows-bookmarks.html\n"
"• Open tabs — import Windows-open-tabs.html the same way; they arrive as a\n"
"  bookmark folder you can 'Open All in Tabs'"
msgstr ""
"¡Listo! Tus archivos de Windows están ahora en tu carpeta personal de "
"Dagric.\n"
"\n"
"Windows en sí no se ha modificado: solo se ha leído.\n"
"\n"
"Para terminar, en Firefox:\n"
"• Marcadores — Marcadores ▸ Administrar marcadores ▸ Importar y respaldar ▸\n"
"  Importar marcadores desde HTML ▸ Windows-bookmarks.html\n"
"• Pestañas abiertas — importa Windows-open-tabs.html de la misma manera; "
"llegan como\n"
"  una carpeta de marcadores en la que puedes usar «Abrir todo en pestañas»"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown only when at least one folder did not copy completely.
#. It sits ABOVE the "Done!" paragraph and has to contradict it, so lead with
#. the negation and keep it first. "Do NOT delete anything from Windows" is
#. the whole point of this block: an owner who believes the copy worked may
#. reclaim the Windows partition next. "Windows itself was still only ever
#. read" keeps the product's central promise intact on the failure path — the
#. copy went wrong, the Windows installation did not.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:590
msgid ""
"⚠ NOT everything was copied.\n"
"\n"
"Some folders did not copy completely — read the messages above, free up "
"disk\n"
"space or check the drive, then run Migration again. Do NOT delete anything\n"
"from Windows until it has finished cleanly.\n"
"\n"
"Windows itself was still only ever read; nothing there was changed."
msgstr ""
"⚠ NO se copió todo.\n"
"\n"
"Algunas carpetas no se copiaron por completo: lee los mensajes de arriba,\n"
"libera espacio en el disco o revisa el disco, y vuelve a ejecutar la\n"
"migración. NO borres nada de Windows hasta que termine sin errores.\n"
"\n"
"Windows en sí solo se ha leído; allí no se ha cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: a warning that a plain-text password file is sitting in the
#. owner's home folder. "Delete it once imported" must survive translation.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:608
msgid ""
"• Passwords — Firefox ▸ Passwords ▸ ⋯ ▸ Import from a File ▸\n"
"  Windows-passwords.csv   (KeePassXC on Pro can import the same file)\n"
"\n"
"⚠ Windows-passwords.csv is PLAIN TEXT. Delete it once imported."
msgstr ""
"• Contraseñas — Firefox ▸ Contraseñas ▸ ⋯ ▸ Importar desde un archivo ▸\n"
"  Windows-passwords.csv   (KeePassXC en Pro puede importar el mismo "
"archivo)\n"
"\n"
"⚠ Windows-passwords.csv está en TEXTO PLANO. Bórralo en cuanto lo importes."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:9
msgid "Dagric Security Checkup"
msgstr "Revisión de seguridad de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:12
msgid "Running a security audit — about a minute…"
msgstr "Ejecutando una auditoría de seguridad: alrededor de un minuto…"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:32
msgid "The audit could not run (it needs administrator access)."
msgstr "La auditoría no se pudo ejecutar (necesita acceso de administrador)."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is a HARDWARE FAILURE warning. The owner's disk is
#. dying and their files are at risk. Keep the urgency — "back up now"
#. is an instruction, not a suggestion.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:44
msgid "Drive health:  ⚠ A DRIVE IS FAILING — back up now!"
msgstr ""
"Estado de los discos:  ⚠ UN DISCO ESTÁ FALLANDO: ¡haz una copia de seguridad "
"ya!"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Kup" is the name of the backup app that ships with
#. Dagric — do not translate it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:50
msgid "A disk is reporting SMART failure — it may die soon."
msgstr "Un disco está informando de un fallo SMART: puede morir pronto."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:54
msgid ""
"Back up your files NOW (Kup is preinstalled), and plan to\n"
"replace the drive."
msgstr ""
"Haz una copia de seguridad de tus archivos AHORA (Kup viene preinstalado) y\n"
"prevé sustituir el disco."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is a "we could not tell" result — neither a pass nor
#. a failure. Keep both halves of the sentence.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:66
msgid "Drive health:  no failures reported, but some drives could not be read"
msgstr ""
"Estado de los discos:  sin fallos notificados, pero algunos no se pudieron "
"leer"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:70
msgid "Drive health:  all drives report healthy (SMART)"
msgstr ""
"Estado de los discos:  todos los discos informan de buen estado (SMART)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:76
msgid "see report"
msgstr "consulta el informe"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:90
#, sh-format
msgid "Hardening index:  $SCORE / 100"
msgstr "Índice de fortalecimiento:  $SCORE / 100"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:91
msgid ""
"Dagric ships hardened by default — AppArmor confinement, a hardened kernel,\n"
"a firewall, and silent security updates are all on before you change a "
"thing.\n"
"Plasma also watches your drives' SMART health and warns you if one degrades."
msgstr ""
"Dagric viene reforzado de fábrica: confinamiento con AppArmor, un núcleo "
"reforzado,\n"
"un cortafuegos y actualizaciones de seguridad silenciosas están activos "
"antes de que\n"
"cambies nada. Plasma además vigila el estado SMART de tus discos y te avisa "
"si\n"
"alguno se degrada."

#. TRANSLATORS: "sudo lynis show details" is a command typed verbatim, and
#. /var/log/lynis.log is a file path. Neither is translated.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:96
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Warnings flagged:  $WARN\n"
"Full report:  /var/log/lynis.log\n"
"For details, run  sudo lynis show details  in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Advertencias detectadas:  $WARN\n"
"Informe completo:  /var/log/lynis.log\n"
"Para ver los detalles, ejecuta  sudo lynis show details  en un terminal."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:18
msgid "HP support installed. Add your printer in System Settings > Printers."
msgstr ""
"Compatibilidad con HP instalada. Añade tu impresora en Preferencias del "
"sistema > Impresoras."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:24
msgid ""
"HP support could NOT be installed — see the messages above. Check your "
"internet connection and try again from the Hub."
msgstr ""
"La compatibilidad con HP NO se pudo instalar: mira los mensajes de arriba. "
"Comprueba tu conexión a internet e inténtalo de nuevo desde el Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:28
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:49
msgid "Finish setting up Dagric"
msgstr "Terminar de configurar Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:30
msgid "Pick what to set up — run this again anytime from the Hub:"
msgstr ""
"Elige qué quieres configurar; puedes volver a ejecutar esto cuando quieras "
"desde el Hub:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:31
msgid "NVIDIA graphics driver"
msgstr "Controlador gráfico de NVIDIA"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:32
msgid "HP printer and scanner support"
msgstr "Compatibilidad con impresoras y escáneres HP"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:33
msgid "Enable Flathub in Discover"
msgstr "Activar Flathub en Discover"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:50
msgid ""
"You are running the live trial from the USB stick.\n"
"\n"
"Anything installed now is kept in this computer's memory rather than on a "
"disk:\n"
"it disappears at shutdown, and on a machine without much RAM it can make "
"the\n"
"trial session unstable. Installing Dagric first avoids both.\n"
"\n"
"Continue anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Estás ejecutando la prueba en vivo desde la memoria USB.\n"
"\n"
"Todo lo que instales ahora queda en la memoria de este ordenador y no en un "
"disco:\n"
"desaparece al apagar y, en un equipo con poca RAM, puede volver inestable "
"la\n"
"sesión de prueba. Instalar Dagric primero evita ambas cosas.\n"
"\n"
"¿Continuar de todos modos?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:115
msgid "Flathub enabled — browse apps in Discover."
msgstr "Flathub activado: explora aplicaciones en Discover."

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when enabling Flathub did not work. It
#. names BOTH causes on purpose — this cannot tell a network
#. failure from a cancelled password prompt, so it must not
#. diagnose one of them and send the owner off to fix the wrong
#. thing.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:123
msgid ""
"Flathub could NOT be enabled — you may be offline, or the password prompt "
"was cancelled. Try again anytime from the Hub."
msgstr ""
"Flathub NO se pudo activar: puede que estés sin conexión o que se cancelara "
"la petición de contraseña. Vuelve a intentarlo cuando quieras desde el Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:99
msgid ""
"No styles are installed. Reinstall the dagric-branding package to restore "
"them."
msgstr ""
"No hay ningún estilo instalado. Reinstala el paquete dagric-branding para "
"recuperarlos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:120
msgid "Accent color — pick any color"
msgstr "Color de acento: elige cualquier color"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:121
msgid "Reset — standard Dagric look"
msgstr "Restablecer: el aspecto estándar de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:124
msgid "Pick a mood — colors, wallpaper, effects. Panels stay put:"
msgstr ""
"Elige un ambiente: colores, fondo de pantalla y efectos. Los paneles no se "
"mueven:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:144
msgid "accent color"
msgstr "color de acento"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:151
#, sh-format
msgid "Accent color set to $HEX"
msgstr "Color de acento establecido en $HEX"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:174
msgid ""
"The standard Dagric style is missing, so nothing was changed. Reinstall the "
"dagric-branding package to restore it."
msgstr ""
"Falta el estilo estándar de Dagric, así que no se cambió nada. Reinstala el "
"paquete dagric-branding para recuperarlo."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:178
msgid "Reset to the standard Dagric look"
msgstr "Restablecer el aspecto estándar de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:190
#, sh-format
msgid "Style applied: $NAME"
msgstr "Estilo aplicado: $NAME"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:31
msgid "Dagric USB Protection"
msgstr "Protección USB de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:35
msgid "USB protection is a Dagric Pro feature."
msgstr "La protección USB es una función de Dagric Pro."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:52
msgid ""
"USB protection can only be set up on an installed Dagric system.\n"
"\n"
"This is the live trial running from the USB stick: the allow-list would be kept\n"
"in memory and lost at shutdown, and any USB drive you plug in before then would\n"
"be blocked. Install Dagric first, then turn this on from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr ""
"La protección USB solo se puede configurar en un sistema Dagric instalado.\n"
"\n"
"Esta es la prueba en vivo desde la memoria USB: la lista de dispositivos permitidos\n"
"quedaría en memoria y se perdería al apagar, y cualquier unidad USB que conectes antes\n"
"de eso quedaría bloqueada. Instala Dagric primero y luego actívala desde el Dagric Hub."

#. TRANSLATORS: the owner dismissed the password prompt, or it failed.
#. Keep "still ON" — the whole point of this tool is that the owner
#. always knows whether the machine is protected.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:131
msgid ""
"Nothing was added — USB protection is still ON and everything you\n"
"already allowed keeps working.\n"
"\n"
"(Adding a device needs administrator access.)"
msgstr ""
"No se añadió nada: la protección USB sigue ACTIVADA y todo lo que\n"
"ya habías permitido sigue funcionando.\n"
"\n"
"(Para añadir un dispositivo se necesita acceso de administrador.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:145
msgid ""
"USB protection is no longer running.\n"
"\n"
"The USB protection service has stopped, so unknown USB devices are\n"
"NOT being blocked at the moment. Restart this computer, then open\n"
"USB protection from the Dagric Hub to switch it back on."
msgstr ""
"La protección USB ya no se está ejecutando.\n"
"\n"
"El servicio de protección USB se ha detenido, por lo que los dispositivos USB desconocidos\n"
"NO se están bloqueando en este momento. Reinicia este equipo y, a continuación, abre\n"
"la protección USB desde el Dagric Hub para volver a activarla."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:164
msgid ""
"Nothing is being blocked right now.\n"
"\n"
"Every USB device plugged into this computer is already allowed, so\n"
"there was nothing to add. If something still does not work, USB\n"
"protection is not what is stopping it.\n"
"\n"
"Protection is still ON."
msgstr ""
"No se está bloqueando nada en este momento.\n"
"\n"
"Todos los dispositivos USB conectados a este equipo ya están permitidos, por lo que\n"
"no había nada que añadir. Si algo sigue sin funcionar, la protección USB\n"
"no es lo que lo está impidiendo.\n"
"\n"
"La protección sigue ACTIVADA."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:174
msgid ""
"Your new device is allowed now.\n"
"\n"
"The USB devices that were being blocked have been added to the\n"
"allow-list, and they stay allowed after you restart.\n"
"\n"
"USB protection is still ON — devices you have not approved are\n"
"still blocked."
msgstr ""
"Tu nuevo dispositivo ya está permitido.\n"
"\n"
"Los dispositivos USB que se estaban bloqueando se han añadido a la\n"
"lista de permitidos, y seguirán permitidos después de que reinicies.\n"
"\n"
"La protección USB sigue ACTIVADA — los dispositivos que no hayas aprobado\n"
"siguen bloqueados."

#. TRANSLATORS: "nothing that already worked has changed" is literally true —
#. this path only ever ADDS allow rules — and it is the sentence that stops a
#. worried owner from switching protection off to be safe. Keep it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:197
msgid ""
"Some USB devices are still blocked.\n"
"\n"
"Dagric could not add all of them. Nothing that already worked has\n"
"changed, and USB protection is still ON.\n"
"\n"
"If your new device still does not appear, unplug it, plug it back\n"
"in, and run this again."
msgstr ""
"Algunos dispositivos USB siguen bloqueados.\n"
"\n"
"Dagric no pudo añadirlos todos. Nada de lo que ya funcionaba ha\n"
"cambiado, y la protección USB sigue ACTIVADA.\n"
"\n"
"Si tu nuevo dispositivo sigue sin aparecer, desconéctalo, vuelve a\n"
"conectarlo y ejecuta esto de nuevo."

#. TRANSLATORS: three buttons, and the body text names two of them in
#. typographic quotes — “Allow my new device” and “Turn protection off”.
#. Those two labels are separate messages immediately below this one;
#. translate them the SAME way in both places or the dialog tells the owner
#. to press a button that is not there. The warning to unplug anything
#. unrecognised is a real one, not filler: this path allow-lists whatever is
#. attached, exactly as the switch-on dialog does.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:232
msgid "Allow my new device"
msgstr "Permitir mi nuevo dispositivo"

#. TRANSLATORS: three buttons, and the body text names two of them in
#. typographic quotes — “Allow my new device” and “Turn protection off”.
#. Those two labels are separate messages immediately below this one;
#. translate them the SAME way in both places or the dialog tells the owner
#. to press a button that is not there. The warning to unplug anything
#. unrecognised is a real one, not filler: this path allow-lists whatever is
#. attached, exactly as the switch-on dialog does.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:233
msgid "Turn protection off"
msgstr "Desactivar la protección"

#. TRANSLATORS: three buttons, and the body text names two of them in
#. typographic quotes — “Allow my new device” and “Turn protection off”.
#. Those two labels are separate messages immediately below this one;
#. translate them the SAME way in both places or the dialog tells the owner
#. to press a button that is not there. The warning to unplug anything
#. unrecognised is a real one, not filler: this path allow-lists whatever is
#. attached, exactly as the switch-on dialog does.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:234
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancelar"

#. TRANSLATORS: three buttons, and the body text names two of them in
#. typographic quotes — “Allow my new device” and “Turn protection off”.
#. Those two labels are separate messages immediately below this one;
#. translate them the SAME way in both places or the dialog tells the owner
#. to press a button that is not there. The warning to unplug anything
#. unrecognised is a real one, not filler: this path allow-lists whatever is
#. attached, exactly as the switch-on dialog does.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:236
msgid ""
"USB protection is currently ON — unknown USB devices are blocked.\n"
"\n"
"Plugged something in and it does not appear? Leave it plugged in\n"
"and choose “Allow my new device”. Everything plugged in and blocked\n"
"right now is added to the allow-list for good, so unplug anything\n"
"you do not recognise first. Protection stays ON and nothing that\n"
"already works is taken away.\n"
"\n"
"“Turn protection off” allows every USB device again, including ones\n"
"you have never seen."
msgstr ""
"La protección USB está ACTIVADA actualmente — los dispositivos USB desconocidos se bloquean.\n"
"\n"
"¿Has conectado algo y no aparece? Déjalo conectado y\n"
"elige “Permitir mi nuevo dispositivo”. Todo lo que esté conectado y bloqueado\n"
"en este momento se añade de forma permanente a la lista de permitidos, así que\n"
"desconecta primero cualquier cosa que no reconozcas. La protección permanece ACTIVADA y\n"
"no se te quita nada que ya funcione.\n"
"\n"
"“Desactivar la protección” vuelve a permitir todos los dispositivos USB, incluidos los\n"
"que nunca hayas visto."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:263
msgid "USB protection is off. All USB devices work normally."
msgstr "La protección USB está desactivada. Todos los dispositivos USB funcionan con normalidad."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:266
msgid "Could not turn it off (administrator access is required)."
msgstr "No se pudo desactivar (hace falta acceso de administrador)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the most consequential dialog in the product. "plug in
#. everything you normally use before continuing" is a WARNING, not advice —
#. a device that is unplugged now really is blocked when it comes back, and
#. that can include the owner's keyboard. Do not soften it, and do not drop
#. the reassurance that this can be re-run or turned off.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:277
msgid ""
"Turn ON USB protection?\n"
"\n"
"Dagric will remember every USB device plugged in RIGHT NOW — your\n"
"keyboard, mouse, webcam, printer, drives — and allow those. Any\n"
"OTHER USB device plugged in later is blocked until you approve it.\n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANT: plug in everything you normally use before continuing.\n"
"Anything unplugged now will be blocked when you plug it back in\n"
"(you can always re-run this to refresh the list, or turn it off).\n"
"\n"
"Protects against malicious USB devices that pretend to be keyboards."
msgstr ""
"¿Activar la protección USB?\n"
"\n"
"Dagric recordará todos los dispositivos USB conectados AHORA MISMO —tu teclado,\n"
"ratón, cámara web, impresora, discos— y permitirá esos. Cualquier OTRO dispositivo\n"
"USB que conectes más tarde quedará bloqueado hasta que lo apruebes.\n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANTE: conecta todo lo que uses habitualmente antes de continuar.\n"
"Lo que esté desconectado ahora quedará bloqueado cuando lo vuelvas a conectar\n"
"(siempre puedes volver a ejecutar esto para actualizar la lista, o desactivarla).\n"
"\n"
"Protege frente a dispositivos USB maliciosos que se hacen pasar por teclados."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:329
msgid ""
"USB protection is ON.\n"
"\n"
"Everything currently plugged in is allowed. New USB devices are\n"
"blocked until you approve them — re-run this tool any time to\n"
"refresh the list or turn protection back off."
msgstr ""
"La protección USB está ACTIVADA.\n"
"\n"
"Todo lo que está conectado ahora está permitido. Los dispositivos USB nuevos\n"
"quedarán bloqueados hasta que los apruebes; vuelve a ejecutar esta herramienta\n"
"cuando quieras para actualizar la lista o desactivar la protección."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the reassuring failure case — nothing was changed
#. and every USB device still works. Keep "nothing was changed" explicit.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:338
msgid ""
"USB protection was NOT enabled — nothing was changed, and all your\n"
"USB devices keep working.\n"
"\n"
"(This needs administrator access, and Dagric deliberately refuses to\n"
"arm USB blocking without a device allow-list.)"
msgstr ""
"La protección USB NO se activó: no se ha cambiado nada y todos tus dispositivos\n"
"USB siguen funcionando.\n"
"\n"
"(Hace falta acceso de administrador, y Dagric se niega a propósito a activar el\n"
"bloqueo USB sin una lista de dispositivos permitidos.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:34
msgid ""
"Windows in a virtual machine is a Dagric Pro feature — the KVM/QEMU\n"
"stack and Virtual Machine Manager are not installed on this edition.\n"
"Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Windows en una máquina virtual es una función de Dagric Pro: en esta "
"edición\n"
"no están instalados ni el conjunto KVM/QEMU ni el Gestor de máquinas "
"virtuales.\n"
"No se cambió nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'libvirt' and 'kvm' are Linux group names typed verbatim —
#. never translate them. KVM, QEMU and "Virtual Machine Manager" are product
#. names; use the name the app shows in your language for the last one only if
#. it really is translated there.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:44
msgid ""
"Dagric — Windows in a window (virtual machines)\n"
"\n"
"Pro ships a complete, open-source VM stack: KVM (the Linux kernel's own\n"
"hypervisor), QEMU, and the Virtual Machine Manager app. A virtual machine\n"
"runs a whole other OS — including real Windows — inside a window, safely\n"
"walled off from your files.\n"
"\n"
"This setup will:\n"
"  1. check that your CPU's virtualization is enabled,\n"
"  2. add your user to the 'libvirt' and 'kvm' groups (needs your password),\n"
"  3. make sure the VM service is running."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — Windows en una ventana (máquinas virtuales)\n"
"\n"
"Pro incluye un conjunto de virtualización completo y de código abierto: KVM (el hipervisor propio\n"
"del núcleo Linux), QEMU y la aplicación Gestor de máquinas virtuales. Una máquina\n"
"virtual ejecuta otro sistema operativo entero —incluido Windows de verdad— dentro\n"
"de una ventana, aislado con seguridad de tus archivos.\n"
"\n"
"Esta configuración va a:\n"
"  1. comprobar que la virtualización de tu CPU está activada,\n"
"  2. añadir tu usuario a los grupos 'libvirt' y 'kvm' (necesita tu contraseña),\n"
"  3. asegurarse de que el servicio de máquinas virtuales está en marcha."

#. TRANSLATORS: "Virtualization", "SVM" and "VT-x" are the literal words on
#. the BIOS/UEFI setup screen, which is firmware and is usually English —
#. keep them in English so the owner can find the setting. F2 and Del are
#. keyboard keys.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:63
msgid ""
"Your CPU's virtualization (Intel VT-x / AMD-V) is OFF or unsupported.\n"
"Usually it just needs switching on in the BIOS/UEFI: reboot, enter setup\n"
"(often F2 or Del), find \"Virtualization\" / \"SVM\" / \"VT-x\", enable, "
"save.\n"
"Then run this again. No changes were made."
msgstr ""
"La virtualización de tu CPU (Intel VT-x / AMD-V) está DESACTIVADA o no es\n"
"compatible. Normalmente solo hay que activarla en la BIOS/UEFI: reinicia, "
"entra en\n"
"la configuración (a menudo F2 o Supr), busca «Virtualization» / «SVM» / «VT-"
"x»,\n"
"actívala y guarda. Después vuelve a ejecutar esto. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:70
msgid "CPU virtualization: available."
msgstr "Virtualización de la CPU: disponible."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:73
msgid "Enable VM support now? [y/N]"
msgstr "¿Activar ahora la compatibilidad con máquinas virtuales? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:91
#, sh-format
msgid "User \"$ME\" added to libvirt+kvm; VM service running."
msgstr ""
"Usuario «$ME» añadido a libvirt+kvm; el servicio de máquinas virtuales está "
"en marcha."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:93
msgid "Could not enable VM support (administrator access is required)."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo activar la compatibilidad con máquinas virtuales (hace falta "
"acceso de administrador)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the numbered steps are a walkthrough of Microsoft's download
#. page and of Virtual Machine Manager. The URL, "swtpm", "OVMF" and "TPM" are
#. literal. The last line is a PRIVACY promise — the owner's files stay outside
#. the VM — so keep it exact.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:102
msgid ""
"Done. One thing to know: group changes apply at your NEXT login —\n"
"log out and back in once before creating your first VM.\n"
"\n"
"To install Windows in a VM:\n"
"  1. Get the Windows ISO from Microsoft's official download page:\n"
"        https://www.microsoft.com/software-download/windows11\n"
"     (Windows in a VM runs unactivated with minor cosmetic limits, or use\n"
"      your existing license key.)\n"
"  2. Open \"Virtual Machine Manager\" from the launcher.\n"
"  3. New VM > Local install media > pick the ISO > give it 4+ GB RAM,\n"
"     2+ CPUs, 64+ GB disk. Windows 11's TPM requirement is covered — Pro\n"
"     ships swtpm (a software TPM) and UEFI firmware (OVMF).\n"
"\n"
"Your files stay outside the VM unless you share them on purpose."
msgstr ""
"Listo. Una cosa que conviene saber: los cambios de grupo se aplican en tu "
"SIGUIENTE\n"
"inicio de sesión; cierra la sesión y vuelve a entrar una vez antes de crear "
"tu\n"
"primera máquina virtual.\n"
"\n"
"Para instalar Windows en una máquina virtual:\n"
"  1. Consigue la ISO de Windows en la página oficial de descargas de "
"Microsoft:\n"
"        https://www.microsoft.com/software-download/windows11\n"
"     (En una máquina virtual, Windows funciona sin activar con pequeñas\n"
"      limitaciones estéticas, o usa tu clave de licencia.)\n"
"  2. Abre «Gestor de máquinas virtuales» desde el menú de aplicaciones.\n"
"  3. Nueva VM > Medio de instalación local > elige la ISO > dale 4 GB de RAM "
"o más,\n"
"     2 CPU o más y 64 GB de disco o más. El requisito de TPM de Windows 11 "
"está\n"
"     cubierto: Pro incluye swtpm (un TPM por software) y firmware UEFI "
"(OVMF).\n"
"\n"
"Tus archivos se quedan fuera de la máquina virtual salvo que los compartas a "
"propósito."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-welcome:31
msgid "The Dagric welcome page is not installed."
msgstr "La página de bienvenida de Dagric no está instalada."

